hev-socks5-tunnel tun2socks daemon

Native OPNsense MVC plugin (no Go controller). Manages hev-socks5-tunnel,
which forwards traffic arriving on a TUN interface through an upstream
SOCKS5 proxy. Typically paired with os-mosdns: resolved proxy domains are
injected into a pf table, policy-routed into the TUN device, and
hev-socks5-tunnel hands them to a local xray-core outbound.

WWW: https://github.com/nxovaeng/nxova-opn-repo
